OL,3,AUS envoys hold talks with Zelensky in
OL,4,AKyiv after meeting Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,7,Fhas held a first round of talks in Kyiv
OL,8,Fwith Donald Trump's top envoys, in
OL,9,Ftheir first visit since Russia's
OL,10,Ffull-scale invasion.
OL,12,FSteve Witkoff, sitting opposite the
OL,13,FUkrainian leader, told reporters the US
OL,14,Fteam felt "encouraged" by what he
OL,15,Fcalled a "substantive" and important
OL,16,Fdiscussion.
OL,18,FJared Kushner said the US president had
OL,19,Finstructed them to find a way to end
OL,20,Fthe war and "create the right
OL,21,Fconditions for a long-term, durable
OL,22,Fpeace".
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
