OL,3,AUS envoys hold talks with Zelensky in
OL,4,AKyiv after meeting Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of the meeting, Zelensky said
OL,7,FUkraine was ready to talk about
OL,8,Fbringing "the end of the war closer".
OL,9,FBut he said security guarantees would
OL,10,Fbe required as well as a dignified
OL,11,Fpost-war peace.
